{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12363","headline":"赠汉阳隐者 · 钱起","name":"赠汉阳隐者","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"当年不出世，知子餐霞人。\n乐道复安土，遗荣长隐身。\n蘅茅古林曲，秔稻清江滨。\n桂棹爲渔暇，荷衣御暑新。\n欵颜行在役，幽兴惜今晨。\n分手天涯去，再来芳杜春。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12363.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12363","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}